Documentation For tank:

This is a beta copy of tank, for you to test to see if this games is any
good. If you like it, please tell me, if you think it sucks please tell
me. If I have a lot of people saying "I like this game" then I will program
future versions, which will actually be half decent.

Tank is a two player game in which you try to kill each other.

To play, each player controls one tank and tries to blow up the other
tank. It takes ten shots to destroy a tank. The first tank destroyed is
the loser and the game ends.

Controls:

        Player #1: Left Tank(Keyboard)   Player #2: Right Tank(Numberpad)
        Up:     W                        Up:     8
        Left:   A                        Left:   4
        Right:  S                        Right:  6
        Down:   X                        Down:   2
        Fire:   SPACE                    Fire:   0

Tank is free software, use at your own risk.

